WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.669 --> 00:00:04.940
Speaker 1: Rudy Giuliani who was recently
accused of being drunk on election night during

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:09.610
which he told Donald Trump, just claim that
you won and gave him all sorts of other authoritarian

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:15.750
advice that led to months and months and really
at this point, years of Trump and others insisting

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.180
that Trump actually won.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:22.270
Rudy Giuliani initially tweeted that he was
not drunk on election night and he has quietly

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:23.660
deleted those tweets.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:30.550
The obvious speculation is Rudy deleted the
tweets because there's going to be undeniable

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:34.789
evidence that Rudy was actually drunk out
of his mind on election night.

00:00:34.789 --> 00:00:38.379
So let's go through this piece by piece.

00:00:38.379 --> 00:00:42.399
Rudy Giuliani deletes tweets denying he was
drunk on election night.

00:00:42.399 --> 00:00:45.489
Explosive claim was made by fellow campaign
staffer.

00:00:45.489 --> 00:00:48.479
So as a reminder, I know many of you already
saw this clip.

00:00:48.479 --> 00:00:52.920
One of the big things at the start of the
second day of hearings with the Trump Riot

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:58.109
Committee was Liz Cheney explaining that Rudy
Giuliani in an inebriated state was the one

00:00:58.109 --> 00:00:59.679
telling Trump, just declare victory.

00:00:59.679 --> 00:01:05.610
Speaker 3: You will hear firsthand testimony
that the president's campaign advisers urged

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:11.460
him to await the counting of votes and not
to declare victory on election night.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:17.729
The president understood even before the election
that many more Biden voters had voted by mail

00:01:17.729 --> 00:01:23.450
because President Trump ignored the advice
of his campaign experts and told his supporters

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:26.030
only to vote in person.

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:31.600
Donald Trump knew before the election that
the counting of those mail in ballots in several

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:38.390
states would not begin until late in the day
and would not be complete for multiple days.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:42.950
This was expected, reported and widely known.

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:47.179
You will also hear testimony that President
Trump rejected the advice of his campaign

00:01:47.179 --> 00:01:53.979
experts on election night and instead followed
the course recommended by an apparently inebriated

00:01:53.979 --> 00:01:54.979
Rudy Giuliani.

00:01:54.979 --> 00:01:55.979
Right.

00:01:55.979 --> 00:02:02.619
To just claim he won and insist that the vote
counting stop to falsely claim everything

00:02:02.619 --> 00:02:03.619
was fraudulent.

00:02:03.619 --> 00:02:04.619
Speaker 1: Yep.

00:02:04.619 --> 00:02:05.619
Okay.

00:02:05.619 --> 00:02:12.709
So initially Rudy Giuliani tweeted, refuting,
denying these claims.

00:02:12.709 --> 00:02:20.540
Rudy tweeting not long ago, quote, I am disgusted
and outraged at the outright lie by Jason

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.340
Miller and Bill Stepien.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:27.030
I was upset that they were not prepared for
the massive cheating as well as other lawyers

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:28.250
around the president.

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:31.900
I refused all alcohol that evening.

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:38.319
My favorite drink, Diet Pepsi, is the false
testimony from Miller and Stepien because

00:02:38.319 --> 00:02:39.650
I yelled at them.

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:42.230
Are they being paid to lie?

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:46.659
Well, Rudy Giuliani has now deleted those
tweets.

00:02:46.659 --> 00:02:53.290
Rudy Giuliani has deleted two tweets in which
the former mayor and attorney for Trump denied

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:57.750
being drunk as votes rolled in on election
night and advising the president to declare

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:58.750
victory.

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:03.870
The two tweets disappeared from Giuliani's
timeline sometime Tuesday evening.

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.500
What is the most simple explanation for this?

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:11.020
